# Capacitor / native Android wrapper — see README's "Android app" section.
# android/ itself IS committed (hand-edited native config lives there);
# only build output, local machine paths, and the disposable web-asset
# copy are ignored. cap add android also writes its own android/.gitignore
# with these same entries — this is a top-level mirror in case that's ever
# regenerated.
node_modules/
www/
android/app/build/
android/build/
# generated from sounds/ by scripts/sync-native-sounds.mjs
android/app/src/main/res/raw/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
android/captures/
android/.cxx/
